  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fldtteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/public-asset-storage/blob/version/latest/image.png?raw=true\" width=\"2913\" height=\"1458\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.minecolonies.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/139070364159311872/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ldtteam/public-asset-storage/blob/version/latest/patreon-img.png?raw=true\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rDNMBiT.png\" width=\"860\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>向 MineColonies 介绍一个令人着迷的扩展：迷人的 TownTalk Addon！在一个世界中沉浸，你的殖民者通过富有表现力和沉浸式的语音交互变得生动起来。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>看着你的村庄因工人的愉快交谈而蓬勃发展，每个工人都有自己独特的语音线路，为游戏体验增添了新的深度。</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>从欢乐的问候到深刻的评论，这个扩展为你的殖民地注入了生命，建立了你和你勤劳的居民之间牢不可破的联系。</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配音演员：<br>- Elle Ray James</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- ShallowVA</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- ItBeMeMrButts</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-&nbsp;Tabsers</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- Sammieqt_</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-&nbsp;Andrew LaRiviere</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-&nbsp;Jodi Hansen</strong></span></p>",
